   "stem": {
      "text": "A drone moves in the xy-plane so that \\( \\frac{dx}{dt} = \\frac{2 t}{t^{2} + 1} + 2 \\) with \\( x(0) = 0 \\), and \\( y(t) = 4 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{t^{2}}{4} \\right)} \\), for \\( t \\ge 0 \\). Using a calculator, find the slope of the line tangent to the path of the drone at \\( t = 3 \\). Show the setup for the calculation, and give the value correct to three decimal places.",
